emailTemplate XXFND_STANDARD (
    name: XXFND Standard
    emailSubject: #SUBJECT#
    htmlFormat {
        body:
            ```html
            <div dir="#DIR#" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
              <p style="white-space: pre-line;">#MESSAGE#</p>
              <p><a href="#ACTION_URL#">#ACTION_LABEL#</a></p>
            </div>
            ```
        footer: <div dir="#DIR#" style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">#FOOTER#</div>
    }
    plainTextFormat {
        content:
            ```html
            #MESSAGE#

            #ACTION_LABEL#: #ACTION_URL#

            #FOOTER#
            ```
    }
    comments {
        comments: Release 82 - the one layout of every COMMON e-mail. XXFND_NOTIFY_PKG fills it with the wording of XXFND_NOTIFICATION_TEMPLATES (plain text per event and language): #SUBJECT#, #MESSAGE#, #ACTION_URL#, #ACTION_LABEL#, #FOOTER#, and #DIR# (rtl for Arabic, ltr otherwise). Applications subscribe to it; they do not copy it.
    }
)
